---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="How to Order | Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="See how to order from the Ruhani Creations by Sumati catalog using WhatsApp, email, or Instagram with product details prepared for you."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container page-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">How to Order</p>
          <h1>Choose a catalog piece and move into a real order conversation in one step.</h1>
          <p class="page-intro">
            Available items on the catalog now include an <strong>Order now</strong> action. It opens a compact order window with WhatsApp, email, and Instagram options while carrying the product code and catalog price with you.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="/catalog">Go to Catalog</a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/contact">View all contact channels</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/generated/rcbs-emblem-dark.png" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati emblem">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container page-stack">
      <section class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Ordering Flow</p>
            <h2>A clean path from browsing to confirmation.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-grid">
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h3>Browse available items</h3>
            <p>Use the catalog filters, open the image gallery, and shortlist the item that fits your occasion, gifting plan, or design requirement.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h3>Tap Order now</h3>
            <p>On every available item, the catalog opens a small order window with your preferred communication options already arranged.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h3>Continue with the studio</h3>
            <p>We then confirm availability, sizing, timeline, pickup or delivery, and the next step toward final order confirmation.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="page-panel detail-grid">
        <article class="detail-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">What moves with you</p>
          <h3>Key product details are prepared before you leave the website.</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Internal item reference</li>
            <li>Product name</li>
            <li>Current catalog price</li>
            <li>Availability status</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="detail-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Reference archive</p>
          <h3>Sold pieces stay visible for inspiration.</h3>
          <p>Some products remain on the catalog even after sale so customers can still review past design work, styling references, and the studio's creative direction. Those items are clearly marked as reference only and do not show the order flow.</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section class="page-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Choose Your Channel</p>
        <h2>Pick the route that feels most natural to you.</h2>
        <div class="contact-channel-grid">
          <article class="contact-channel">
            <div class="contact-channel-head">
              <span class="contact-icon icon-whatsapp">WA</span>
              <div>
                <span class="contact-tag">Fastest Route</span>
                <h3>WhatsApp</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Best for quick product checks, size questions, appointment coordination, and order confirmation conversations.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="contact-channel">
            <div class="contact-channel-head">
              <span class="contact-icon icon-email">@</span>
              <div>
                <span class="contact-tag">Written Thread</span>
                <h3>Email</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Best when you want a documented thread for gifting requirements, repeat coordination, or follow-up details.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="contact-channel">
            <div class="contact-channel-head">
              <span class="contact-icon icon-instagram">IG</span>
              <div>
                <span class="contact-tag">Social DM</span>
                <h3>Instagram</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Instagram does not support prefilled messages, so we copy the product details for you first and then open the profile so you can paste them into your DM.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="contact-channel">
            <div class="contact-channel-head">
              <span class="contact-icon icon-review">RC</span>
              <div>
                <span class="contact-tag">Studio Support</span>
                <h3>Need help choosing?</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>If you are not sure what to order, start with the catalog anyway. The studio can help you narrow the right piece once you share the event, budget, and preferred style direction.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>